In one of the Nethack 3.1 spoilers the author asks what happens if you offer
the amulet to the wrong god.

Well playing in Wizard mode the following happens:

The amulet is successfully offered. The new god accepts your devotion and
protects you from the wrath of your old god, who REALLY wants to kill you.
You are covered in an orange mist and then the game is over. You are officially
listed as having escaped the dungeon. You DO NOT become a demi-god and as such
have NOT completed the game!

